# Content Preview folder icon

For **folder icons in Content Preview** (Project view, `Folders` section), use the shared component:

```tsx
import { FolderIcon } from "@/components/preview/FolderIcon";

<FolderIcon size={iconSize} />
```

## Do not

- Do **not** use `lucide-react` `Folder`, `FolderOpen`, or other generic folder icons in Content Preview folder cards.
- Do **not** duplicate the SVG inline in `FolderPreviewItem` or sibling components — import `FolderIcon`.
- Do **not** change fill colors or paths without updating the Figma source and spec.

## Canonical asset

| Field | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Component | `sources/gui/frontend/src/components/preview/FolderIcon.tsx` |
| Figma | [shadcn-ui kit — `Icon/128/folder`, node 4026:5054](https://www.figma.com/design/Vhp8g306WGBcjSzL4lnl23/shadcn-ui--The-Ultimate-UI-Kit-for-Figma--Community-?node-id=4026-5054) |
