| viewBox | `0 0 48 48` |
| Tab fill | `#A8A29E` |
| Body fill | `#D6D3D1` |
| Default size | `48` (scale via `size` prop with `thumbScale`) |

## When updating the icon

1. Export SVG from Figma node `4026:5054` (or its successor in the kit).
2. Update paths/fills in `FolderIcon.tsx` only.
3. Update `.cursor/interface/folder-preview-item.md` if dimensions or colors change.

Sidebar and other panels may use different folder icons unless the spec says otherwise.
